Package: alsdownloader
Title: Discover and Download Airborne Laser Scanning Data
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cesar Ivan", "Alvites Diaz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "calvites1990@gmail.com"),
    person("Carlos Alberto", "Silva", role = "ctb"),
    person("Viswanath", "Nandigam", role = "ctb"),
    person("Chelsea", "Scott", role = "ctb"),
    person("Inacio", "Bueno", role = "ctb"))
Description: Search airborne laser scanning point-cloud tiles by polygon,
    inspect acquisition metadata, and download selected assets with resumable
    transfer records. Supports the USGS 3D Elevation Program through
    Planetary Computer and local OpenTopography tile indexes. Includes a
    responsive 'Shiny' interface, provider access notes, bounded point-cloud
    previews, and configurable local download concurrency.
License: GPL-3
Contact: Cesar Ivan Alvites Diaz <c.alvitesdiaz@ufl.edu>
Encoding: UTF-8
